msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "WonderSwan R Audio Decoder"
msgstr "WonderSwan R audio dekoder"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "WonderSwan R (WSR) is a container format, that holds audio code ripped from the ROMs of games for the WonderSwan and WonderSwan Color handheld game system. Both the original and color versions used the same audio chip which could handle 4 PCM audio channels."
msgstr "WonderSwan R (WSR) je kontejnerski format koji sadrži audio kod izcjepan iz ROM-ova igara za prenosne igraće sisteme WonderSwan i WonderSwan Color. I originalna i verzija u boji koristile su isti audio čip koji je mogao obraditi 4 PCM audio kanala."
